Dialogue: 0,1:43:49.00,1:43:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,《敢死队》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.13,0:00:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是阴影\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are the shadows{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.50,0:00:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,或是烟雾 我们患难与共\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the smoke, we rise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.39,0:01:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是鬼魂 隐藏...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are the ghosts that hide...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.10,0:01:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,...在夜色中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...in the night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.10,0:01:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,(索马里 亚丁湾)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.64,0:03:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,人质在我们手上太久了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.74,0:03:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,三个月了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.78,0:03:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,太久了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.82,0:03:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,有人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.03,0:03:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,要为此付出代价
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.20,0:03:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你们公司有足够的时间付钱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.22,0:03:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,可你们不在乎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.83,0:03:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不顾他们的死活
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.48,0:03:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,不救他们
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.85,0:03:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也不在乎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.84,0:03:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的死
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.33,0:03:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,都是你们
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.73,0:03:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,造成的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.05,0:03:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,别开枪！ 别开枪！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't shoot me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.98,0:03:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,什么人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.98,0:03:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,包里是钱 把人质放了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's your money. Release the hostages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.94,0:03:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,多少钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much in there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.02,0:03:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 300万 - 太晚了 现在我们要500万了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Three. - You're too late. We want $5 million.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.74,0:04:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,死到临头还这么贪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck, it's humid!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.45,0:04:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,最后一次机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last chance!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.24,0:04:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,要还是不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take it or leave it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.62,0:04:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,放心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All at ease!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.29,0:04:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,坐下 根拿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a seat, Gunner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.13,0:04:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 你们只会光说不做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you're all cannon and no balls!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.13,0:04:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,给我们500万 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We want the money now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.88,0:04:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是警告 - 别！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Warning shot. - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.30,0:04:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,打低了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little low.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.19,0:04:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,拉灯！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lights out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.51,0:05:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我杀了他！你们再动 我就杀了他！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll kill him! I swear I'll kill him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.51,0:05:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我建议你放了人质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I were you, I'd take this opportunity to leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.18,0:05:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么想?坚持一下?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your call? You stayin'?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.35,0:05:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 试试吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, we tried.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.65,0:05:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,老子把他们全杀了！绝不手软\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll kill them all! I don't care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.02,0:05:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这世上傻子太多了 所以住手吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's more fools in this world than people. So back off, cuz.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.15,0:05:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你住嘴！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You back off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.03,0:05:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,反正你左右是个死 所以我闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, you're gonna be dead anyway. So I'm gonna shut up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.74,0:05:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,最后一次机会 放了人质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last chance. Let the hostages go{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.45,0:05:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不然你就完蛋啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or you're out of there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.62,0:05:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,把钱拿过来 拿到这儿来…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring the money here to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.25,0:05:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我自己还缺钱呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need the money myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.59,0:05:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,左边四个交给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take the four on the left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.21,0:05:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 又来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, here we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.26,0:05:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,右边两个是你的 剩下的人交给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you take the two on the right and leave the rest alone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.55,0:05:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,老子把他们全杀了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll kill them all!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.84,0:05:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你该盯住右边那两个 你的身手不行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should take the two on the right. You're not that fast anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.85,0:05:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,只有闪电才能快过我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only thing faster is lightning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.47,0:05:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,“闪电” 真行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Light!" Get original!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.39,0:05:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,子弹肯定比刀快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bullets go faster than blades.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.61,0:06:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走着瞧！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.77,0:06:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,马上把钱拿过来！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring the money here! Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.99,0:06:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,想要钱吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want the money?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.57,0:06:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,自己过来拿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.91,0:06:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,干掉他们！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.62,0:06:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 我们打平了 - 作梦吧你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I call that a tie. - Come on, keep dreaming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.08,0:06:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,省省吧 伙计们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little compassion, folks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.00,0:06:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜你一个也没打中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I don't think you hit one of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.00,0:06:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,事实上 你的刀也不怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't see any knives, actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.34,0:06:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,现在300万还能买啥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three million doesn't buy much nowadays.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.43,0:06:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你们在干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are you guys doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.56,0:06:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他在那干嘛? - 吊海盗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What the hell is he doing? - Hanging a pirate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.18,0:06:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,别开玩笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be ridiculous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.64,0:06:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,根拿! 你在那干嘛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gunner! What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.77,0:06:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,吊海盗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hanging a pirate!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.94,0:06:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真是个神经病 - 这可不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That is seriously demented. - This is no good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.94,0:06:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不是像你认为的那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but put one in Speed Racer's shoulder. Not that you'd feel it, but put one in Speed Racer's shoulder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.61,0:06:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你自己拿主意 - 真够义气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're on your own. - Appreciate it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.62,0:06:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,有朋友真好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's good to have friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.24,0:06:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 根拿 - 干嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Gunner. - Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.04,0:06:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是我们的风格 放了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't how we work. Let him go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.54,0:06:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么?换作他 也会这样对付我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why? He'd do it to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.00,0:07:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道这样做不太正常 对不对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what you're doing is a little crazy, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.13,0:07:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那是他的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's his problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.38,0:07:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,那也是你的问题 别发疯！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's your problem, too. It's a little sick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.38,0:07:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 别碰我的钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, don't touch my money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.34,0:07:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,根拿 最后一次机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gunner, last chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.10,0:07:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,放了他 否则开除你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let him go or we're letting you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.22,0:07:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,吊海盗没有错 这是维京传统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's good to hang pirates. Old Viking custom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.89,0:07:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这根本不是维京传统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It isn't an old Viking custom at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.33,0:07:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不用那种方式杀人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't kill like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.87,0:07:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗?不够文雅?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah? Not polite enough?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.00,0:07:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 放了他 根拿 - 你最近怎么样 巴尼?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let him go, Gunner. - How are you doing, Barney?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.21,0:07:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,非常好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretty good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.50,0:07:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我这位哥们刚用钢头靴踢了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My partner here kicked me with steel-tipped boots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.67,0:07:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你说荒不荒唐 - 你活该\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can you believe that? - You deserved it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.05,0:07:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我想可能要缝两针\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I'll need stitches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.22,0:07:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,也许\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.68,0:07:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我恨缝针 - 我们都恨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I hate stitches. - Everyone does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.89,0:07:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,放了他 根拿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let him go, Gunner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.22,0:08:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,放了他?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let him go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.48,0:08:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,放了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let him go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.20,0:08:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他现在冷静了吗? - 去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Think he's cool? - Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.10,0:08:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,根拿 你不会犯混吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gunner, you cool?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.52,0:08:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.36,0:08:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不用 你留着吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, keep it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.07,0:08:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你懂刀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You appreciate a good blade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.75,0:13:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,来啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.21,0:13:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,哪一个?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.38,0:13:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,有一天 你会遇上一个对你一往情深的男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someday you'll find a man who'll be happy just to watch you sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.39,0:13:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不知道你回来了 - 你好 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi. I didn't know you were back. - Hey, babe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.48,0:13:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I just arrived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.39,0:13:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 你看起来棒极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey. - You look great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.48,0:13:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该给我打个电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish you would have called.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.36,0:13:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,打电话我不在行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never been a good caller.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.36,0:13:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你一个月都没和我联系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't heard from you in over a month.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.36,0:13:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗?时间过的真快 你说是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really? Time flies, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.24,0:13:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,下不为例！对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Won't happen again! Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.53,0:13:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 给你一个惊喜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I do have a surprise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.37,0:13:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,玫瑰味的 你的最爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rose-flavored. Your favorite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.37,0:14:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一件东西送给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I did have something else for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.38,0:14:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,是我在缅甸为你选的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's something I picked up from Burma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.01,0:14:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,一颗红宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a ruby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.39,0:14:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,颜色很漂亮 不过灯光太暗 有点看不出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a good color, but it's hard to see in this light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.85,0:14:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,在商店买的时候 看起来很闪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This kind of looked a little shinier when I bought it in the shop, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.98,0:14:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,赖斯 没事吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lace, everything all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.07,0:14:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没事 - 他是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - Who is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.91,0:14:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,一个朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.12,0:14:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,天很晚了 你叫什么名字?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kind of late. You got a name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.58,0:14:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,朋友 她刚刚说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Friend. She just told you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.25,0:14:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,李 别这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lee, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.46,0:14:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样 李 对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't leave like this. Lee, I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.34,0:14:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为我们相处的很不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought things were good between us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.97,0:14:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得你不关心我 也不想让我了解你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I felt like you never cared about getting in my life or letting me into yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.34,0:14:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别走 - 没错 你说的一点不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stop. - Yeah, sure I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.64,0:14:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不 彼此认真对待的话不应该是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Not the way two people who are serious about each other do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.85,0:15:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我认识你已经一年半了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have known you for over a year and a half,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.60,0:15:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,可我连你是干什么的都不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I don't even know what you do for a living.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.86,0:15:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这有什么关系? 我对你一心一意 这就足够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's it matter? When I'm here, I'm with you. That matters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.44,0:15:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,可事实是 你对我心不在焉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That matters, but when you're here, you're not really here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.99,0:15:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你没对我说话 你根本就没和我交心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay? You don't talk to me. You don't open up to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.78,0:15:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我真不知道你会这么想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have no idea what you're feeling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.41,0:15:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你送我礼物 非常漂亮的礼物 但我想要的是你！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You bring me presents. They're beautiful presents but I want you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.41,0:15:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个好人 我爱你 可…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a good man. I love you, but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.42,0:15:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 赖斯！ - 我讨厌这个人的声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Lace! - I hate his voice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.09,0:15:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你说什么? - 别让他过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you say something? - Don't let him come down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.59,0:15:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you say something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.84,0:15:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别让他… - 保罗 等我一下 行吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do not let... - Paul, just give me a second, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.02,0:15:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,李 我很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lee, I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.44,0:15:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我 你明白我说的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please tell me you understand what I'm saying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.27,0:15:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你一定得理解我 - 我理解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You have to understand. - I understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.07,0:15:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你多保重 - 保重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You take care. - Take care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.99,0:15:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,他不是好人 赖斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's no good, Lace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.74,0:16:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,兄弟 你是不是从来不睡觉?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, brother, don't you ever sleep?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.79,0:16:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这位是我朋友…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my friend...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.50,0:16:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你叫什么来着 宝贝?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your name again, baby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.75,0:16:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 夏安 - 夏安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Cheyenne. - Cheyenne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.13,0:16:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,夏安 阿拉帕霍 切诺基 波尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cheyenne, Arapaho, Cherokee, Pawnee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.21,0:16:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,想喝一杯吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want a drink?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.76,0:16:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不用了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.22,0:16:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,宝贝 上楼…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you run upstairs{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.93,0:16:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,为我调一杯超强的 加六颗橄榄的马提尼 好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and get me one of them super-duper six-olive martinis, baby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.31,0:17:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 让我干什么都行 宝贝 - 会让你满意的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Anything for you, baby. - You got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.10,0:17:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 小妞 喜欢我 - 就像前面50个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Got a crush on me. - Like the last 50.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.56,0:17:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,兄弟 妞越多越好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, brother, who's counting?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.19,0:17:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 奶奶的 你看起来不错 - 瞧瞧你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Damn, you look good. - Look at you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.90,0:17:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,还是硬汉一条 兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look like a goddamn cold piece of steel, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.94,0:17:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 哥们 帮我画完这只鸟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well. Okay, my friend, let's finish this bird up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.74,0:17:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,快点吧 兄弟 几年了 才画了几个字母\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, let's do it, bro. It's taken you a couple of years to do a couple of letters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.79,0:17:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得开除 根拿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We had to get rid of Gunner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.46,0:17:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他又发疯病了 不能再留了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, he went Crankenstein on your ass. You got to cut him loose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.84,0:17:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你想入伙吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna fill in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.75,0:17:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,老实说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me tell you something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.92,0:17:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,还记得我们上次在哪儿吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember where we was last time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.92,0:17:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在哪?当时我们泡在泥血里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where were we? We were ass-deep in that mud and blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.80,0:17:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 尼日利亚 - 没错 你的手被打的一塌糊涂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nigeria. - Yeah, your hand was all shot to shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.89,0:17:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你血流成河 我也浑身挂彩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were bleeding all over the place, and I was bleeding,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.39,0:17:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道 我干了件什么事吗? 我对自己说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you know what I did? I promised myself,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.94,0:17:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想孤零零地 像个马蜂窝似的死在全是血的烂泥里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't wanna die all alone, full of holes in the mud and blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.98,0:17:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我要死得其所 我要和女人死在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna die with something that counts. I'm gonna die with a woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.61,0:17:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我要和一个关心我的人死在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna die with someone who cares about me, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.36,0:17:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会为女人去死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't wanna die for a woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.07,0:18:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想死在女人身边 这就是我的愿望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna die laying next to a woman. That's what I want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.79,0:18:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这下热闹啦 - 没错 我从这里就能闻到他的味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's Christmastime. - Yeah, I can smell him from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.59,0:18:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,克里斯莫斯 最近还好吗 兄弟?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Christmas. How you doing, brother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.43,0:18:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 杜尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm good, Tool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.72,0:18:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,太太好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's the missus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.22,0:18:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, all good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.43,0:18:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.77,0:18:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧瞧这个 你觉得怎么样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, take a look. What do you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.98,0:18:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来 还是像只黑乎乎的鸡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It still looks like a black chicken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.19,0:18:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,黑乎乎的鸡?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Black chicken?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.32,0:18:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,哥们 见到你真好 兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man. It's good to see you, brother. Miss you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.03,0:18:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,今天晚上你看上没什么精神啊 怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're looking very beige tonight. What's up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.66,0:18:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,和平常一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The usual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.83,0:18:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 一切都好 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All good? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.04,0:18:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我有个好主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a great idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.50,0:18:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,让我为你画上两笔 画一个…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you let me doodle, like, a...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.46,0:18:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,在你头上纹个蜘蛛网怎么样? 就纹在你的头顶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charlotte's web on your head? On the top of your head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.88,0:18:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,来点花样 搞点气氛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, something different, something exciting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.59,0:19:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你这个圆溜溜 肉绷绷的脑袋真是绝了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause you got one of them perfectly-shaped domed, muscular heads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.64,0:19:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我纹个蜘蛛网在你头顶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could put a web on the top of the head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.14,0:19:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,也许再弄个怀了孕的蜘蛛精 从你耳朵里钻出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe a pregnant Charlotte coming out of your ear,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.98,0:19:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,四下张望 不让虫子进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}peeking around, making sure them bugs don't come inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.56,0:19:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,她的长腿悬在你的脖子上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her long leg dangling down your neck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.19,0:19:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 性感 对吗? - 非常性感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. Sexy, right? - Very sexy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.07,0:19:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他看起来很激动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He looks thrilled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.32,0:19:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉你 今晚我觉得运气不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well. Okay, I'll tell you what. I'm feeling a little lucky tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.53,0:19:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得很准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm feeling very accurate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.04,0:19:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 下次再说吧 - 别这样 打败他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Another time. Come on. - Come on, take him on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.08,0:19:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 克里斯莫斯 出手吧 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Christmas. Bring it, baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.96,0:19:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,别起哄 求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't encourage him, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.42,0:19:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,他这辈子都别想打败你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He never beat you in your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.58,0:19:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 克里斯莫斯 输刀不输人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Christmas, no disgrace in losing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.73,0:19:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,哪位?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.02,0:19:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.11,0:20:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.24,0:20:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我接了三个活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I got three pieces of work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.08,0:20:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,其中两个小菜一碟 另一个龙潭虎穴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two a walk in the park, and one to hell and back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.08,0:20:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我想一个人静一段时间 - 振作 约对方出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I need some time alone. - Hey, cheer up. Make the meeting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.12,0:20:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,(瓦里拉岛)
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.16,0:21:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,老大
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.67,0:21:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,将军！叛徒抓回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.94,0:21:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你偷了我的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.87,0:21:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,尊敬的阁下我从来没偷过你的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.43,0:21:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这块土地上没有任何东西属于你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.72,0:21:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,所有的一切都是我的 明白吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.76,0:21:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我以我孩子的性命发誓 我真的没偷
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.36,0:21:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白 可我没法看透你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.93,0:21:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么知道你说的是不是真话?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.51,0:21:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我们看清楚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now we can see inside of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.64,0:21:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,他说谎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I see lies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.02,0:22:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,他不是偷你的东西 是偷我们的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wasn't stealing from you. He was stealing from us both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.15,0:22:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你想让你的那些蠢货尊重你吗? 灭了这两个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want your apes' respect? Snuff those two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.92,0:22:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不用拐弯抹角\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's just keep it simple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.50,0:22:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,只要价钱好 我们不在乎在哪干活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the money's right, we don't care where the job is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.75,0:22:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 明白吗? - 我们不用浪费时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Got it? - Let's quit jerking off,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.88,0:22:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,谈生意吧 让我看看你想不想干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}get down to business, see who's hungry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.84,0:22:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你的真名也许不叫巴尼·罗斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know your real name's probably not Barney Ross.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.80,0:22:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你也不必知道我的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't need to know my name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.76,0:22:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你只要知道一件事 这份活是真的 钱也是真金白银\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only thing you need to know is the job's real and the money's real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.35,0:22:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,既然我们现在身处这种好地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But since we're in this nice place,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.90,0:22:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你姑且就称我为教堂先生吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you might as well just call me Mr. Church.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.15,0:22:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 教堂 我能为你做什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, Church. What can I do for you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.69,0:22:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,稍等一会 我还在等一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In a minute. I'm still waiting for one more guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.70,0:22:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.71,0:23:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你认识他?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.79,0:23:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我们以前是一个小队的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, we used to be on the same team together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.92,0:23:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我这个老不死的“好朋友”在这干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's my oldest, worst friend doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.09,0:23:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你们两位都是我们的首选\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Both of your names came to the top of the list.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.88,0:23:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有什么问题吗? - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is that a problem? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.93,0:23:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我早该一枪干掉他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should've shot him when I had the chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.93,0:23:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,大个子巴尼·罗斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Big Barney Ross.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.68,0:23:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,胖子地老鼠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bigger Trench mouse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.68,0:23:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你在这干什么?让上帝赏口饭吃? - 也许\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you doing? Praying for work? - Could be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.90,0:23:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,最近身体不好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you been sick?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.40,0:23:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你瘦了 - 是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You've lost weight. - Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.77,0:23:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我的肉倒全让你长去了 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever weight I lost, you found, pal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.90,0:23:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你们不会想掏出鸡巴 互相搞一搞吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys aren't gonna start sucking each other's dicks, are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.66,0:23:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我们谈生意吧 看看谁想干这份活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get down to business, see who wants the work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.79,0:23:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你们听说过一个叫维林那的小岛吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ever hear of an island called Vilena?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.46,0:23:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.00,0:23:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,海湾里的一个小岛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a little island in the Gulf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.63,0:23:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.96,0:23:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你应该多学点文化 - 多谢提醒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You should read more. - Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.26,0:23:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我的人对岛上的一些资源很感兴趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are resources on that island that my people are very interested in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.47,0:23:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,可一个叫加尔萨的将军推翻了临时政府\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But a general by the name of Garza has overthrown the half-ass government.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.31,0:24:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.77,0:24:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我的人和这个叫加尔萨的政治狂人 发生了点小矛盾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My people are having a problem with this fanatic Garza.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.36,0:24:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你想让加尔萨滚蛋? - 我想让他死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So you want Garza gone? - I want him dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.82,0:24:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,只需要出动一支小部队就行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All it takes is a little army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.48,0:24:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,只有白痴才会干这个活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only an idiot would do this job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.32,0:24:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 多少钱? - 果然不出我所料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How much? - Oh, like I said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.83,0:24:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我很忙 这活给我这位朋友做吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm busy anyway, so give this job to my friend here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.66,0:24:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,他超喜欢在丛林里打滚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He loves playing in the jungle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.29,0:24:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我说的对吗? - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Right? - Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.75,0:24:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,找个时间一起吃个饭?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, why don't we have dinner?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.42,0:24:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊 什么时候?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure. When?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.84,0:24:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 等你死了以后 - 太快了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- In a thousand years. - Too soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.01,0:24:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他是不是他妈的有毛病? - 他想当总统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's his fucking problem? - He wants to be president.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.43,0:24:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,首先 我得去岛上侦察一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got to recon this island first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.35,0:24:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我会为你在岛上安排一个接头人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll have a contact for you on the island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.56,0:24:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,早走早好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good riddance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.44,0:24:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜没人敢接你这个活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a feeling everyone else has passed on this job,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.57,0:24:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我要500万美金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so our fee is $5 mil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.98,0:24:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 500万? - 先付一半\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- $5 mil? - And I want half upfront,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.78,0:24:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,另一半汇入海外账户\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the other half in an offshore account.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.36,0:24:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有问题吗? - 没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You got a problem with that? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.66,0:25:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我很介意被人耍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What I have a problem with is people who try to fuck me over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.92,0:25:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你拿了钱 却不干活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So if you take this money and you don't deliver,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.96,0:25:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我还有我的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}me and my people{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.46,0:25:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,会把你和你的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are gonna come get you and your people{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.68,0:25:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,剁成一块一块的去喂狗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and chop you up into little fucking dog treats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.68,0:25:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,听懂了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got a problem with that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.27,0:25:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,谈谈细节吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.25,0:25:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不管是谁臭了你 看来都很糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoever stood you up sounds bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.04,0:25:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 不过报酬很不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but it will pay good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.59,0:25:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 先不谈钱 你的准则是怎么回事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, money aside. What happened to your code?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.75,0:25:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,什么准则\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What code's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.09,0:25:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,“目标必须值得去做”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"The target has to deserve it."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.01,0:25:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,兴趣不足 已经作废了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was canceled due to lack of interest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.68,0:26:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你真黑 又黑又冷 - 被你发现了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're dark. Dark and cold. - You noticed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.27,0:26:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 顺便说一下 我可不吃这一套 - 你会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And I ain't buying into that, by the way. - You will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.86,0:26:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,去附近转转吧 年轻人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stick around, young man, you will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.45,0:26:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,维林那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vilena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.96,0:26:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,又有新活了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next job?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.21,0:26:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,是要去那吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They got work there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.55,0:26:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.30,0:26:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你不该来这 根拿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know you shouldn't be here, Gunner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.22,0:26:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,别扔下我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't replace me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.26,0:26:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我能行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.89,0:26:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我还能行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm still good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.06,0:26:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你还在吸毒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're still using.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.56,0:26:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我没法再相信你 哥们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't trust you anymore, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.15,0:26:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你不相信我? - 是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You can't trust me? - Hmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.03,0:26:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你不相信我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't trust me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.32,0:27:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.99,0:27:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你不相信我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't trust me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.59,0:27:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你小心点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.96,0:27:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你在威胁我吗 根拿?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You threatening me, Gunner?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.17,0:27:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,没有 我心肠好着呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nah, I'm a nice guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.35,0:27:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,根据这个叫教堂的家伙给我的资料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, going over the info this guy Church gave me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.73,0:27:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,这个岛大约有6000人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there's probably about 6,000 people on the island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.07,0:27:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,有多少士兵?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many soldiers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.53,0:27:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,大概几百个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe a couple of hundred.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.32,0:27:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,几百个士兵足以控制这个小地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wouldn't take much more than that to control a space that small.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.07,0:27:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你真明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.78,0:27:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了 他们是一支小型部队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great, they've got a small army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.12,0:27:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我们呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do we got?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.41,0:27:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,只有四个半人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Four and a half men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.46,0:27:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,真令人作呕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That smells disgusting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.08,0:27:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,作呕? 我的鸡肉秋葵汤坏了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Disgusting? Chicken gumbo is bad,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.21,0:28:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不过老鼠和猩猩奶头吃起来很美味?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but eating on rats and gorilla nipples, that's delicious?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.43,0:28:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,一点也不好笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not so funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.55,0:28:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我要加工资 - 为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I need a raise. - Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.18,0:28:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我要为我儿子多存点钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need more money for my son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.89,0:28:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我要送他上好学校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to send him to a better school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.89,0:28:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 阴阳什么时候成的家? - 不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did Yin Yang get a family? - I have no idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.14,0:28:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你们没问 我废什么话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't ask, I don't tell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.44,0:28:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 还是像以前那样分成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway, the pay share stays the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.19,0:28:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,以后也一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the way it's gonna be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.61,0:28:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,目标人物是加尔萨将军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now the target on this island is a guy named General Garza.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.24,0:28:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他犯了什么事? - 谁管他犯了什么事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's the problem? - Who gives a shit what the problem is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.74,0:28:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我们自己的麻烦就够多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got enough problems right here of our own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.99,0:28:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这些问题不解决 我们都完蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't get rid of those first, they're gonna get rid of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.37,0:28:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,托尔·鲁德 你什么时候看的医生?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toll Road, when was the last time you saw your analyst?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.33,0:28:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 今天早上 - 是吗?医生怎么说的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This morning. - Yeah? What'd you talk about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.26,0:28:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,逃避型人格障碍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Avoidant personality disorder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.59,0:28:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你想得太多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think too much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.76,0:28:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,托尔·鲁德 你不是一般人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, Toll Road, you're a great guy, a little fucked up, no doubt about it,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.60,0:28:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 一定会有不一般的问题 知道吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you're always gonna have unusual problems, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.47,0:28:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 你在说我的耳朵?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - You're talking about my ear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.39,0:28:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,又来了 别再说你的耳朵了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Don't start with the ear again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.02,0:28:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别再说你耳朵上的那点事了 - 别再说耳朵了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Not the ear story. - The ear story, not again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.35,0:28:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们都听过 - 我们不想再听了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We all know the ear story. - We don't want to hear the ear story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.44,0:28:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你们都知道我在大学摔过跤 - 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We all know I wrestled in college. - Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.94,0:29:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,摔跤运动员的耳朵通常会有血块\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A common injury associated with that sport is trauma to the ear, a clot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.03,0:29:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,如果不管它 会导致耳软骨萎缩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which, if left unattended, causes a contraction in the cartilage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.37,0:29:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,变成开花耳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and forms cauliflower ears.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.66,0:29:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我的室友总是没完没了地 说起我耳朵的形状\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My college roommate used to bring up my ear configuration all the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.42,0:29:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不管是在聚会 还是社交\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Parties, social events, you name it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.46,0:29:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,其实我倒真不太在意他说这些 因为他经常吹捧我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That didn't really bother me all that much because he's usually bragging about{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.00,0:29:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,说我的耳朵是勇气的象征\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how my ears are a badge of courage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.76,0:29:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 让我都有些不好意思 - 当然了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Made me a little less self-conscious. - Of course it would.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.64,0:29:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,但这一切很快就结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But that was short-lived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.55,0:29:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,春假里的一天早上 我听到他在背着我打电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One morning, during spring break, I hear him on the phone, bagging on me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.89,0:29:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,说到了我“怪异的耳朵”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}talking about my "queer ear."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.40,0:29:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么可笑的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see something funny?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.73,0:29:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 你继续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, go ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.65,0:29:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我这才意识到仅仅是外表上的不同 我就已经变成了一个笑柄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I realize I'd become the brunt of a joke simply because I look a little bit different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.24,0:29:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我决定教训一下我的室友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I decided to educate my roommate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.57,0:29:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,对于外表有所不同的人 应该给予正常的礼貌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on the common decency that should be afforded people who look a little different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.62,0:29:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我猛撞他的臭脑袋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I smashed him upside his goddamn head!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.83,0:29:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,…一下又一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Several times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.21,0:29:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,直到他的脑袋开花\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until he had a little cluster of cauliflower all his own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.67,0:30:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你想说什么? - 病人不容易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And your point is? - It ain't easy being green.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.67,0:30:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你们以为我他妈的在说什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fuck you think I'm talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.01,0:30:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 我和克里斯莫斯会去一趟维林那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway, me and Christmas are gonna head down to Vilena{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.14,0:30:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,探探岛上的情况 看看这活能不能接\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and scout the island to see if we should take the job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.31,0:30:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,对方付我们多少钱?我需要钱养家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much we get paid? I need more money for my family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.23,0:30:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,养什么家?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What fucking family are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.86,0:30:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.36,0:30:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道 别问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, don't ask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.21,0:30:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 那女孩不适合你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, that girl wasn't your type.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.34,0:30:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,是她没福气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her loss, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.84,0:30:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我应该敲碎那混蛋的下巴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should have broke that bastard's jaw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.84,0:30:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你也许逃过一劫 被敲碎下巴的人可能是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you were lucky. He could have broke yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.80,0:30:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不可能 - 克里斯莫斯 我理解你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Impossible. - You know, Christmas, I understand,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.56,0:30:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,一时的相处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but let's just say you were with her for a couple of hours,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.64,0:30:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,或许很甜蜜 很刺激也很情意绵绵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it's nice, and it's hot and heavy,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.56,0:31:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,可之后呢 会怎么样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but after that, think about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.69,0:31:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来你要干什么呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you do for the rest of the day?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.90,0:31:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,也许分手对你是件好事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She probably did you a favor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.61,0:31:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你可以多留点时间给自己了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you have more time to feel sorry for yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.45,0:31:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你真是个冷血混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a bleak bastard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.26,0:32:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好 早上好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morning. Morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.98,0:32:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好！会说英语吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morning! Speak English?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.23,0:32:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,好大的飞机啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Big plane, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.40,0:32:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 我们用它运送受伤的动物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, we use it to transport injured animals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.32,0:32:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 为什么到这来? - 我们是鸟类学家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why are you here? - Ornithologists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.99,0:32:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,到这里拍些珍稀鸟类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're photographing exotic birds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.79,0:32:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你很紧张吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're nervous?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.96,0:32:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,紧张?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nervous?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.67,0:32:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,没有啊 为什么这么说?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.84,0:32:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你看起来很紧张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just look nervous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.05,0:32:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我不紧张 我紧张吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not nervous. Do I look nervous?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.76,0:33:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你的皮肤有点干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your skin looks a little dry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.93,0:33:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,一定是飞的太高了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's because of the altitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.23,0:33:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不是因为太高了 你开飞机的时候 应该把窗子关上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's not the altitude. You fly with the window open all the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.81,0:33:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 脱水 - 对 是脱水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dehydration. - Yeah, it is dehydration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.11,0:33:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不过还是有办法解决的 干细胞什么的 换新皮肤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But there's ways to get around that. There's new skin, it's like stem cell research.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.11,0:33:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你看上去很帅 不用担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are looking handsome. Don't worry about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.28,0:33:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你嫉妒了? - 有一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're jealous? - I'm a little jealous. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.20,0:33:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你还年轻 风华正茂啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're younger. You have youth on your side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.53,0:33:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,总的来说 我还是喜欢我现在这样子 你呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Overall, I'm happy to be myself. Are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.83,0:33:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你说完了 - 说完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So you're done. - Done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.17,0:33:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 很高兴认识你 - 很高兴认识你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good to know you. - Good to know you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.04,0:33:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一直这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, we do this all the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.96,0:33:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,互相开玩笑 这样在飞行当中能保持清醒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We kid ourselves. That's how we stay awake on the plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.30,0:33:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是飞机上唯一清醒的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm the only one who stays awake on the plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.92,0:33:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他总是睡觉 - 说得对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's always sleeping. - Yeah, you're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.13,0:34:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 地址在哪? - 在我脑子里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's the address? - Yeah, it's in my head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.05,0:34:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,能告诉我吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you wanna share it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.51,0:34:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,凯莱酒吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the Gloria Cantina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.51,0:34:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,用西班牙语说 应该是酒吧凯莱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So actually, Cantina Gloria in Spanish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.77,0:34:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,西班牙语 你以为你是谁 佐罗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spanish. Who are you, Zorro?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.69,0:34:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,军人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.19,0:34:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 该死 - 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shit. - Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.57,0:34:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.29,0:34:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 在拍吗? - 拍了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You rolling? - No, I'm on holiday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.72,0:34:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你 你 把卡车挪开！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, you, move the truck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.43,0:35:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,拍那个穿西装的 来个特写\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the suit. Tighten up on the suit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.02,0:35:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,拍好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.15,0:35:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,看看这些小丑 一群莽夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at these clowns, hand-picked monkeys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.33,0:35:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,看得出有什么不对劲吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong with this picture?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.21,0:35:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,所有的事都不对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.08,0:35:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我们离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.00,0:35:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,不 问题就在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, that's the point, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.46,0:35:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为很了解一个人 可事实上不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think you know someone, and you truly do not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.97,0:35:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是说过:“没有女人也能过的男人”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aren't you the guy who said, "The man who best gets along with women...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.05,0:35:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,“才是最会与女人相处的”吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is the man who can get along without them"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.10,0:35:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不对 不对 你没认真听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no. You're so not listening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.18,0:35:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我说的是如果你被女人控制住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm talking about when you give all the control to the woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.89,0:35:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你就失去了主动权 - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You relinquish the power. - Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.81,0:35:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 姑娘获得了主动 - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You give it all to the girl. - Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.86,0:35:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,真到了那时候 她会挖出你的心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right at that very moment is the time that she will tear out your heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.69,0:36:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,再去和送奶工滚床单 最后怀上陌生人的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She'll screw the milkman, she'll get pregnant with a stranger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.91,0:36:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我告诉你 真的会这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm telling you, it's exactly what's happening{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.28,0:36:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,而且每次交新女朋友都会重复发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it's repeating itself every relationship I have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.91,0:36:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,一模一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.00,0:36:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,事实上 她不适合你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Truthfully, she wasn't your type.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.21,0:36:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这事没完 - 好好享受一下单身生活吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, I wasn't finished. - Look, enjoy your freedom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.75,0:36:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 迟早也轮到你 - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, you wait till it happens to you. - It has.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.42,0:36:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,两位想喝点什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.93,0:36:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不用 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.22,0:36:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,接头人来迟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Contact's late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.76,0:36:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.01,0:36:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,别急\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.23,0:36:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这个干果长腿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of the nuts has legs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.06,0:36:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我讨厌这身衣服 我讨厌这帽子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate this outfit. I hate this hat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.02,0:36:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,摘下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take it off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.24,0:36:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你被女人甩过吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you ever been rejected?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.37,0:36:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我死了你会伤心吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you be sad if I was dead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.59,0:37:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你再说 我就要发火了 知道吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're really pushing the boundaries of our relationship, you know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.36,0:37:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那个是接头人吗? - 可能是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is that the contact? - Could be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.61,0:37:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,她长的真一般\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too bad she's so homely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.99,0:37:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,别走神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay focused.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.62,0:37:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你是接头人吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you the contact?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.91,0:37:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫桑德拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Sandra.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.70,0:37:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你们叫什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are your names?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.04,0:37:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,布达 佩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Buda, Pest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.05,0:37:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,请跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow me, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.22,0:37:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,布达和佩斯?好极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Buda and Pest? Nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.81,0:38:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这些都是你画的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you do all these?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.32,0:38:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 送你一幅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Take one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.15,0:38:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,算是礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A gift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.36,0:38:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,无功不受禄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't take free gifts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.83,0:38:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这张多少钱? - 不收钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How much you want for it? - Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.62,0:38:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,送人礼物不能收钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Taking money for something is not a gift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.16,0:38:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不收任何回报才叫礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Taking nothing for something is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.04,0:38:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这里一直像这样吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it like this all the time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.92,0:38:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,过去这里是个美丽的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This place was a beautiful place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.67,0:38:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,后来 来了一伙有钱人 加尔萨将军就把自己出卖了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then one day, they came with money, and General Garza sold his soul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.13,0:38:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不服从的人全被杀了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And people who fight back are killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.14,0:38:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你说来了一伙人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said "they" came with money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.47,0:38:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他们什么来头?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's "they"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.51,0:38:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我只知道他们是美国人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some Americans. That's all I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.93,0:38:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 总有一天一切都会恢复原样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But someday all of this will change back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.81,0:38:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的这么想吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really believe that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.02,0:38:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.53,0:38:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你家里还有些什么人 桑德拉?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a family, Sandra?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.61,0:38:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我妈妈在我很小的时候就死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My mother, when I was little, she died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.03,0:38:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我爸爸 也死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And my father, he's gone, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.87,0:38:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.99,0:38:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我? - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Me? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.08,0:38:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,他有一辆卡车和一架水上飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has a truck and a seaplane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.83,0:39:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,桑德拉 能尽可能靠近宫殿吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sandra, how close can you get to the palace?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.79,0:39:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,宫殿?干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The palace? Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.96,0:39:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我们想看看风景\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just wanna check out the view.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.72,0:39:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,那里没风景可看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no view.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.92,0:39:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不管怎么说 带我们去一趟吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't we just go there anyway, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.02,0:39:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我要的收成在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is my grove?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.74,0:39:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你的工人在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is your manpower?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.49,0:39:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道古柯叶要多久才有收成吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know how long it takes for a coca field to produce?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.95,0:39:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你当然不知道 让我告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course you don't. Let me tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.71,0:39:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我们比预计的迟了八个星期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are eight weeks behind schedule.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.96,0:39:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,给你的农民吃点苦头 把我的东西快点种出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kick your peasants' asses. Get me my product.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.42,0:39:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你在我的人面前 用这种口气和我说话 很不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you talk like this to me in front of my men, it's no good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.43,0:39:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你们靠我吃饭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am your lifeline.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.80,0:39:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,靠我平息了动乱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am the one who coordinates all this confusion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.39,0:39:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我在给你财路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am making you rich.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.77,0:39:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,有钱是件好事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And being wealthy is very good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.89,0:40:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,钱可以让人肆无忌惮 随心所欲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It allows people to be the real asswipes nature intended them to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.57,0:40:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,有些东西钱买不来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes things are just not worth the money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.74,0:40:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,金钱是万能的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure they are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.34,0:40:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,桑德拉 我想问问你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sandra, I was wondering about something you were saying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.42,0:40:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 从女性的观点来看… - 你在干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- From a female point of view... - What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.13,0:40:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,谈话 找出答案 完全出于好奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Conversing. Look it up. Out of curiosity,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.47,0:40:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你经历过你喜欢的人冒犯你吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you ever have a person you liked disrespect you in a bad way?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.64,0:40:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,冒…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dis...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.93,0:40:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道怎么用西班牙语说“冒犯”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not sure what the Spanish is for "disrespect."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.31,0:40:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,又来了 天啊 你怎么还不能振作起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Why don't you man up? Jesus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.52,0:40:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,她不适合你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She wasn't your type.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.65,0:40:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你再说一遍“她不适合我”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you just keep saying, "She wasn't my type?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.32,0:40:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我就一枪崩开你空空的脑袋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I could put a bullet in your bleak brain!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.03,0:40:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,看看我在和谁说话 吸血鬼的生活导师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look who I'm talking to. Dracula's life coach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.74,0:40:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,难怪你现在还是单身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No wonder you're alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.74,0:40:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,桑德拉 快到了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sandra, are we close?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.08,0:40:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,就在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.66,0:41:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 请把车停下 - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Pull over, please. - Yeah, really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.09,0:41:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他要去哪儿? - 我很高兴你这么问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where is he going? - I'm glad you asked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.51,0:41:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I suppose you could say{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.17,0:41:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢以不同的角度看世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we like to look at the world from different views.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.18,0:41:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,至于你…狼心狗肺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You... You got a black heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.35,0:41:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,她不适合你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She wasn't your type.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.61,0:41:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我们上路吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should get going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.53,0:41:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,他这个人情绪波动很大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's very emotional.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.66,0:42:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你们在找什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you looking for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.08,0:42:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,桑德拉 你有没有给我们下套?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sandra, how do I know you're not setting us up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.33,0:42:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我连“下套”是什么意思都不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does "setting us up" mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.46,0:42:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你不像干这行的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't look like the kind of person that we deal with all the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.84,0:42:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么干这行?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you get involved in this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.22,0:42:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,来过一个美国人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An American came here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.09,0:42:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他让我朋友带你们四处转转 我朋友害怕了 所以让我代替他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He asked my friend to show you around. He was afraid, so he asked me to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.26,0:42:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你不害怕吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're not afraid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.43,0:42:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我也害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.14,0:42:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,可他说你们也许能帮我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he said maybe you can help Vilena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.27,0:42:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我不这么认为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.94,0:42:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.23,0:42:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,要想让这地方走回正轨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To get this place going again,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.48,0:42:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,必须把现有的一切都推倒重来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you have to rip the guts out of it and start from the ground up{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.69,0:42:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不觉得值得这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and even I don't think that's worth the money,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.45,0:43:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说 如果我是你 我就赶紧走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so if I were you, I'd leave. Just leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.00,0:43:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,该走应该是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.59,0:43:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,别开口 我来说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't say anything. Let me talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.03,0:43:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.56,0:43:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不许动
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.32,0:43:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,他在这干什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.89,0:43:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉过你不许到这儿来
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.69,0:43:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.77,0:43:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,维林那不是你们的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.37,0:43:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我们警告过你
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.93,0:43:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,就算是将军的女儿也一样可以格杀勿论
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.30,0:43:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你们没有权利管我
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.31,0:43:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,带她见她父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.99,0:43:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.09,0:43:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.53,0:44:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 去救她 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get her. - Got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.88,0:44:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你疯了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you crazy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.51,0:44:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 差点把我干掉！ - 不用客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You could have killed me! - You're welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.76,0:44:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.81,0:44:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,开快点 我们来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, speed it up. We're on the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.48,0:44:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们能逃出去 就是奇迹了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we get out of here, it's a miracle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.74,0:45:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 她和我们一起走 是吗? - 最好是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She's coming with us, right? - She'd better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.41,0:45:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们怎么离开这里? - 我们有一架飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How can we leave? - We got a plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.08,0:45:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 我不能离开 - 一定得走 你没得选\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, I can't leave. - Yeah, well, you don't have a choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.66,0:45:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 我不走 - 什么?他们一个小时就能找到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes, I do. - Yeah? They'll find you in an hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.79,0:45:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 也许吧 但我还是选择留下 - 留下干什么?这里没什么可留恋的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Maybe, but I'm staying. - Staying for what? There's nothing here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.62,0:45:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.80,0:45:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 如果你留下 必死无疑 她和我们一起走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, if you stay, then you're dead. She's leaving with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.97,0:46:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 里面的人我来处理 - 帮我拖住他们一分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I got the guys inside. - Give me a 60-second lead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.43,0:46:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 明白 走 走 走！ - 快来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You got it. Go, go, go! - Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.70,0:46:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.99,0:46:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 进去 - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get in. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.12,0:46:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 进去 - 不 不 我不能走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get in. - No, no, I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.75,0:46:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们快走 - 我不能走 我的家在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's go. - I can't. I belong here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.62,0:46:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没时间了 - 走 你快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There's no time. - Go, you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.83,0:46:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,求你 快走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.67,0:46:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,该死！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.35,0:47:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.36,0:47:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你看起来很紧张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look nervous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.71,0:47:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,快点！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.36,0:47:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑 你个混球！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run, you bastard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.65,0:48:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那女孩呢? - 走了 她不愿离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's the girl? - Gone. She wouldn't leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.95,0:48:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不愿离开?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wouldn't leave?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.57,0:48:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,谁愿待在这种鬼地方?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why the hell would anybody wanna stay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.63,0:48:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,去她的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The hell...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.55,0:48:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,去她的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The hell with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.05,0:48:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 飞吧 宝贝 飞吧 - 快点 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Climb, baby, climb. - Come on, baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.52,0:49:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God damn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.99,0:49:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 回去? - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Going back? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.53,0:49:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 送他们下油锅 - 送他们下油锅 干吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Fry and die. - Fry and die. Let's do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.90,0:50:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,他们想干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are they doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.00,0:50:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,爽！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.76,0:51:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,干的好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.93,0:51:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我们下了战书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was a statement!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.62,0:51:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,两个职业杀手怎么可能通过安检\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did two obvious professionals pass right through security personnel,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.33,0:51:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了41个士兵 然后逃走的呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}kill 41 soldiers and get away?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.88,0:51:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,有人协助 肯定是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With help, that's how.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.21,0:51:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,所有的事都控制在我们手里 除了一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything's under control, except one detail,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.47,0:51:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,一个想让自己的老爸和公司 一起完蛋的好女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a daughter who wants her father and company dead and gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.14,0:51:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,真是家门不幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bad Shakespeare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.26,0:51:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我的手下已经去抓她了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somehow the company parasites got to her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.14,0:51:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,她是你女儿 我很遗憾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, she's your daughter, and that's tragic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.69,0:51:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,可是 无论如何 她都得死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But blood or not, she goes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.65,0:51:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是做生意的代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call it the price of doing business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.19,0:51:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,虎毒不食子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't kill your familia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.57,0:52:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,过年过节怕寂寞的话 就到我家来 哥们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come around my house during the holidays, pal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.34,0:52:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,鸟不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice bird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.68,0:52:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,首先 和一个拿枪大汉谈生意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First of all, I don't feel comfortable{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.55,0:52:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得很不舒服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}talking business with a giant carrying a shotgun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.27,0:52:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这位帅哥不肯交枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretty boy wouldn't give it up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.06,0:52:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,除非你们不想找他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not if you wanna know where they are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.69,0:52:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道些什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.06,0:52:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我以前和他们是一伙的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I used to be one of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.82,0:52:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么你要背叛他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you turning on them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.03,0:52:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,意见不合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lovers' quarrel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.61,0:52:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你5万\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We settle on 50.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.70,0:52:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不成 精明人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, math whiz.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.53,0:52:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我要10万 预付\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We settle on 100 grand, upfront, in my pocket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.87,0:52:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙想犯混啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The guy thinks he's a real badass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.87,0:52:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,其实 我在做恐怖秀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, I'm a horror show.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.63,0:52:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这老家伙真他妈搞笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This geezer's a bloody joke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.42,0:52:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,生活就是一个玩笑 蠢货！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Life's a joke, gum-chew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.55,0:53:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我在一个屁大的地方站了 整整六个小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been standing in a space about the size of your mouth for six hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.05,0:53:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,如果不想让我把你的丑脸 打个稀巴烂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you don't want that Fu Manchu knocked back into the '60s,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.47,0:53:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,就给我闭上这张臭嘴 放尊重点！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'd better keep your gum-chewing trap shut and show some respect!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.39,0:53:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.39,0:53:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,想整容吗 帅哥?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Need a facelift, pretty boy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.90,0:53:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,拿过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.19,0:53:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,住手 潘恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back off, Paine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.32,0:53:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,老子要杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna kill him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.40,0:53:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.36,0:53:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,住手！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.74,0:53:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我想事情大概是这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's what I think is happening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.54,0:53:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这个自称教堂的家伙 是中央情报局的一个头头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This guy who calls himself Church is really a front for the CIA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.08,0:53:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说 我们在为中央情报局干活?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we're working for the agency?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.25,0:53:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 教堂雇我们去干掉将军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Church hired us to take out the General,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.63,0:53:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,但真正的目标是这个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James Munroe but the real target's this guy, James Munroe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.59,0:53:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,他以前也是中央情报局特工 之后财迷心窍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He used to be with the agency, but got greedy,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.01,0:53:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,背叛了情报局 并和将军结成了团伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}went rogue and teamed up with the General{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.68,0:53:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,控制了毒品生意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to keep the whole drug operation for themselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.10,0:53:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这么一来情报局损失巨大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that's a big cash loss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.18,0:53:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,但教堂和情报局不敢让海豹突击队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Church and the agency can't afford to send in the Navy SEALs{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.23,0:53:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,或者特种部队去收拾自己人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or the Special Forces to take out one of their own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.19,0:54:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这样影响非常不好 所以他们就雇了我们去杀他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That'd be a bad headline, so they hire us to kill him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.36,0:54:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,然后他们重新掌握毒品生意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they're back in business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.99,0:54:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 再把我们干掉 - 神不知鬼不觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And we're taken out. - Nobody's gonna miss us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.49,0:54:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是不是出价500万? - 你有钱也没命花\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is it still $5 million? - You'd never live to spend it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.95,0:54:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我要通知教堂交易取消\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm telling Church the deal's off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.87,0:54:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你们觉得怎么样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sound about right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.50,0:54:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,就这么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's about right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.71,0:54:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I agree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.82,0:54:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你的头盔还在吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You still got the helmet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.95,0:54:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.92,0:55:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是谁? - 小混混\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who the hell is that? - Some punk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.80,0:55:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别管他 - 有我们呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't worry about it. - We got your back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.34,0:55:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,他敢过来 我们就让他满地找牙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he comes over here, we'll bust his ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.73,0:55:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.19,0:55:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,要你的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.44,0:55:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我早就想这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was thinking about taking it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.65,0:55:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.77,0:55:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,可我在小房子里会很不舒服 所以进号子有点讨厌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I don't do so well in tight spaces, so going to prison worries me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.07,0:55:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你不该打她的脸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shouldn't have bruised her face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.53,0:55:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,打了又怎么样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.62,0:55:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢她的脸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would have liked to have kept it the way it was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.87,0:55:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,这婊子你留着吧 老子已玩腻了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep the bitch, 'cause I'm done with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.28,0:56:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,李\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.91,0:56:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,下一次 我让你做不成男人 朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next time, I'll deflate all your balls, friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.42,0:56:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你该知道我是干什么的吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you know what I do for a living.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.63,0:56:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我不完美 但你应该等我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not perfect, but you should have waited.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.09,0:56:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我值得你等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was worth it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.33,0:57:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,她在哪儿?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.18,0:58:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你女儿也会画画?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So your daughter paints, too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.85,0:58:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,都是理想惹的祸！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is how it starts!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.85,0:58:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走 这里什么也没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing here. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.40,0:58:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都结束了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or how it ends!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.06,0:58:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了 巴尼?你从不睡觉吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter, Barney? Don't you ever sleep?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.23,0:58:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不睡 你的女朋友呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. What happened to your girlfriend?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.73,0:58:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,又吹了一个 兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another one bites the dust, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.23,0:58:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我本来要为她纹这个 你猜怎么? 我会继续画完\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was gonna paint this for her, and you know what? I'm gonna finish it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.86,0:59:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,然后 把它砸个稀巴烂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I'm just gonna smash the shit out of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.37,0:59:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你想一个人待着吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna be alone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.41,0:59:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不需要 有心事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not really. So, what's up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.91,0:59:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,在岛上 遇见了一个女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On this island, there was this girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.92,0:59:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,很平常啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There usually are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.25,0:59:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,她是我们的向导 也是目标人物的女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, she showed us around. She was the target's daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.80,0:59:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,她本来可以和我们一起走 可她不走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when she had a chance to leave, she didn't do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.01,0:59:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,很勇敢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She had some guts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.39,0:59:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,可我为什么老是想着她?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why can't I get that out of my mind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.44,0:59:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,她代表着一些东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, she stands for something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.77,0:59:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,哥们 我们的人生空无一物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, man, we don't stand for shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.48,0:59:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,曾经有过 可都被生活磨掉了 就像这幅画\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We used to, but that dried all up, like this is gonna dry all up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.86,0:59:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,慢慢地干掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This here paint is gonna dry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.12,0:59:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没了什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What dried up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.95,0:59:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,没了信仰 哥们 失去对灵魂的信仰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just belief, man. Just the belief in the soul,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.50,0:59:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道怎么说 人性 兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just, I don't know, the human parts, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.13,0:59:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,还记得我们那次在波斯尼亚吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You remember that time we was up in Bosnia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.21,1:00:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们干掉了那伙塞尔维亚混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We took down them Serb bad boys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.93,1:00:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的弟兄都被砍死在我们身边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All our guys were getting chopped up all around us,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.14,1:00:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,血流成河\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and there was blood everywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.06,1:00:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我从没想过能活着离开那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never thought I was gonna make it out of there,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.89,1:00:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我知道你也没想过 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- and I know you didn't, either. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.56,1:00:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,觉得自己已经死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kind of feeling like dead, too, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.19,1:00:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我陷入了一片黑暗之中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My head's all a very black place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.03,1:00:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我失去了信仰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't believe in shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.86,1:00:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,只有该死的血一样的黑暗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just goddamn Dracula black.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.91,1:00:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我记得我喝了一瓶当地的烈性酒 梅子白兰地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I remember I got this bottle of the local shit they have over there, that Slivovitz.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.67,1:00:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我记不清了 好像是叫这个名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, I think that's what it was called.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.67,1:00:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我感觉不痛了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I ain't feeling no pain now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.38,1:00:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,之后 我上了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'd come up on this...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.55,1:00:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我上了一座老木桥 我看见…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd come up on this old wooden bridge, and I see this...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.76,1:00:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我看见…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see this...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.39,1:00:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我看见一个女人站在那 她…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see this woman standing there, you know? And she's...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.44,1:00:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我走了过去 她看见了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I stepped out, and she saw me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.07,1:01:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,直勾勾地看着我 我也看着她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and she's just looking right in my eyes, and I was looking right in her eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.45,1:01:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道她想干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew what she was gonna do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.49,1:01:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,她看着我 我知道她想跳下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She looked at me, and I knew she was gonna jump.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.20,1:01:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我干了什么吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what I did, man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.33,1:01:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我转过身 离开了 之后就听见落水声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just turned around and I kept walking, until I heard that splash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.34,1:01:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,她就这么死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then she was gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.84,1:01:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,在那儿 杀了那么多人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And after taking all them lives,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.39,1:01:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,终于有机会救一个人的时候 我却没救\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}here was one that I could have saved, but I didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.52,1:01:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,后来我意识到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what I realized later on was,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.23,1:01:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我当时救了那个女人 我也许…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if I had saved that woman, I might have,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.99,1:01:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,也许就能留下一些人性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, saved what was left of my soul, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.40,1:02:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,桑德拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sandra,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.65,1:02:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,是阿历克斯桑德拉的简称 拉丁语的意思是“人类的守护者”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}short for Alexsandra, which is Latin for "Defender of mankind,"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.82,1:02:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 你就是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, bingo, here you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.08,1:02:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,人如其名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now that's synergy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.66,1:02:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你听不懂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not following that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.66,1:02:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你可能也不懂 毕竟你们国家里98%都是文盲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I know you're probably not, illiteracy being 98% in your country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.25,1:02:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,试试看吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try following this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.30,1:02:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,一个很有智慧的故人曾经告诉过我 真正的男人绝不打女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A very wise dead man once told me that a real man never strikes a woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.97,1:02:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,最多吓吓她们 但绝不动手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You push some if you have to, but you never strike them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.98,1:02:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,可是 这个人却没有那种善心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This man, however, does not share that moral dilemma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.98,1:03:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我 桑德拉 美国人为什么到这来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So the question, Sandra, why were the Americans here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.30,1:03:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.50,1:03:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么不跟他们走?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.90,1:03:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你杀了那么多人
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.47,1:03:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么不把我也杀了?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.25,1:03:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,把我也杀了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.15,1:03:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你杀了那么多人 干嘛不把我也杀了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.32,1:03:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你这个凶手！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.93,1:03:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,放开我 放开我
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.18,1:03:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,让我出去 快让我出去
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.27,1:03:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,让我出去 放开我
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.39,1:03:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你们这些混蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.48,1:03:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,放开我 你们这些混蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.87,1:03:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,别反抗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't fight back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.33,1:03:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,别怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just relax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.03,1:04:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,再问一次 美国人对你说了什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Again, what did the Americans tell you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.49,1:04:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在查谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who were they after?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.87,1:04:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,继续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Continue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.31,1:05:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要答案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanted answers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.77,1:05:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不是这样！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not like that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.40,1:05:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么都行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever you say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.41,1:05:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我要回维林那 - 真的吗?事情有变化?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm going back to Vilena. - Yeah? Something change?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.46,1:05:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有什么计划? - 没有计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's the plan? - There is no plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.29,1:05:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 等等 等等 我们得筹划一下 - 我一个去 你们不用去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wait, wait, wait. We need a strategy. - I'm going. You're not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.76,1:05:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么? - 我说了我一个去 你们不用去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - I said I'm going. You guys aren't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.63,1:05:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你干什么 是不是疯了? - 这是我一个人的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you, out of your mind? - It's personal business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.47,1:05:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你不欠那个女人什么 - 我没说我欠她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You don't owe that woman nothing. - I didn't say I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.14,1:05:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你想自杀吗?去吧 随你的便\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to kill yourself? Go ahead, fine. Your call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.27,1:05:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我不想自杀 你们多保重 我必须去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, I don't want to kill myself. You guys, take care. I got to do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.35,1:05:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 嘿 嘿 - 干嘛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, hey, hey. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.35,1:05:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能这样对我们 让我们内疚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't lay this guilt crap on us. We don't deserve it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.19,1:05:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的选择 不需要内疚 不需要 保重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my choice. There's no guilt. There's no guilt. Take care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.41,1:06:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,他妈的 他自己选的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, fuck it. His choice. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.34,1:06:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我说过我一个人去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said I'm going alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.55,1:06:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我也去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.76,1:06:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,阴阳 别闹 快滚出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Yang, get the hell out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.72,1:06:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,开车吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just drive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.77,1:06:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,别害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't lose your nerve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.65,1:06:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,给我闭嘴 人渣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't talk to me, cockroach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.45,1:06:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么要这么做?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, why are you doing this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.58,1:06:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,要死一起死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Friends die together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.04,1:06:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,把我的幸运戒指还我 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. Give me the good luck ring. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.59,1:06:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,别让我发火 阴阳 给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't make me hurt you, Yang. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.63,1:06:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 速度比幸运更重要 - 随便你怎么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Speed better than luck. - Whatever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.22,1:07:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不容易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's difficult.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.72,1:07:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.01,1:07:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我过的不容易 我需要更多钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My life is difficult. I need more money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.18,1:07:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么这么说?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.23,1:07:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我比别人工作更努力 - 别人和你一样努力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I work harder than the rest. - No, you don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.39,1:07:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我比别人努力 因为他们比我高 做任何事我都得多出力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I do. Because they're taller, everything is harder for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.11,1:07:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,受伤后 伤口看起来都比别人的大 因为我个子小\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I get hurt, the wound is bigger because I'm smaller.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.24,1:07:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,走路 我得比别人多走几步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I travel, I need to go farther.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.16,1:07:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了 因为你个子小 对不对?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know, 'cause you're smaller, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.07,1:07:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.08,1:07:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我活的比你想像的要难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My life is harder than you think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.58,1:07:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我需要更多钱 - 我知道了 你说过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I need more money. - I know. You told me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.92,1:07:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,要养家 是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For your family, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.50,1:07:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't have family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.92,1:07:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.51,1:07:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,也许将来会有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe one day I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.88,1:07:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,趴下！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.54,1:08:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你去外面！ - 为什么让我去?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get out there! - Why me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.25,1:08:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你个子小\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you're smaller.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.31,1:08:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,再这么干 老子灭了你！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do that again, I'll kill you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.84,1:09:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,根拿！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gunner!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.64,1:09:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 根拿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Gunner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.19,1:09:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,身手不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.72,1:09:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么?你死定了 粉虫！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing? You're dead, junkie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.02,1:09:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,贱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Insect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.00,1:10:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,跳！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bail!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.92,1:10:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,该死！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.04,1:10:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,阴阳！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yang!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.87,1:10:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,出来 出来 不管你在哪儿！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come out, come out, wherever you are!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.12,1:10:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's over!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.71,1:11:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我们谈谈吧 我原谅你了 阴阳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's talk about this. I forgive you, Yang!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.34,1:11:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,差点伤了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That almost hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.93,1:11:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,住手！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.10,1:11:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你穿多大号的鞋 三号? 打我啊 大脚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you wear, size three? Bring it, happy feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.59,1:11:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,轮到我了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, bring it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.09,1:12:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,鞋号我说对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Size matters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.73,1:12:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,根拿！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gunner!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.81,1:12:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,运气不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, karma!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.86,1:12:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.64,1:13:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你对我开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shot me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.06,1:13:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不怪我 你想杀他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, don't say that. You were gonna kill him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.89,1:13:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想吓吓他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I was just gonna scare him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.77,1:13:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,别装了 你从来没喜欢过他 你想杀他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't say that. You never liked him. You were gonna kill him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.11,1:13:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.24,1:13:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我会死吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I dying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.12,1:13:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这一枪差点打中心脏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The shot's a couple of inches above your heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.21,1:13:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,根拿 是谁派你来的? 谁雇的你?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gunner, who sent you? Who hired you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.92,1:13:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,现在还有关系吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who cares?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.38,1:13:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,就当帮我一个忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who cares? I care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.46,1:13:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,别犯混了 你这辈子够混了 就随和一次吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't go out a total asshole. For once, cooperate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.64,1:13:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,是谁派你来的?谁雇的你? 告诉我 让我挽回局面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who sent you? Who hired you? Tell me. Let me make it right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.18,1:14:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,好好安葬我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bury me right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.85,1:14:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要一个维京式葬礼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I want a Viking funeral.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.98,1:14:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说把你放到一条船里 然后火葬?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean where they put you in a boat and set you on fire, Viking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.57,1:14:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 太对了 - 你不是维京人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's right! - You're not a Viking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.07,1:14:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,那又怎么样?没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what? Who cares?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.15,1:14:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我答应你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If that's what you want, you got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.49,1:14:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,谁派你来的?是谁? 那个女孩还活着吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who sent you? Is the girl still alive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.28,1:14:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,靠近点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come closer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.64,1:14:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,做你朋友真不容易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, it's not easy being your friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.06,1:14:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.35,1:14:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,哥们 要死一起死 只要别让我们死两次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, we'll die with you. Just don't ask us to do it twice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.35,1:14:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我想了个计划 路上详谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know the layout. I'll tell you about it on the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.02,1:14:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你又怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell happened to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.73,1:14:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,说来气人 不说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's too sad to talk about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.95,1:14:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我们上路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's fly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.67,1:15:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,敌人其实很害怕噪音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, the enemy's always been terrified of noise,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.09,1:15:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,特别是枪声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}especially shotguns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.31,1:15:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙一分钟能喷250发子弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With this big boy spitting out 250 rounds a minute,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.98,1:15:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你说说看 谁能不害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you tell me who's tolerating that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.98,1:15:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我信任你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what? I trust you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.52,1:15:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,见见我的女朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to meet my girlfriend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.36,1:15:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,欧米亚·凯波姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Omya Kaboom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.40,1:15:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,子弹发射以后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When Omya's prime is struck,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.37,1:15:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,她会释放出一个加强小弹头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she gets off a miniature warhead that arms itself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.91,1:15:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这个时候 任何挡在她前面的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when that happens, anything that gets in my lady's way{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.96,1:15:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,都会被炸成一团肉泥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}becomes instant red sauce and Jell-O.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.75,1:15:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,如果还不够\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if that doesn't work,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.26,1:15:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,她的妹妹随后就到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}her sister will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.09,1:16:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我再理一遍 根拿想杀你 你开枪杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So let me get this right. Gunner tries to kill you, you shoot him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.93,1:16:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,临死以前 他对你坦白了敌人的计划?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and, at death's door, he gives you the whole layout?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.93,1:16:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,差不多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.10,1:16:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,但我答应他要安排一个维京式葬礼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I had to promise him this Viking funeral.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.27,1:16:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须把骨灰撒到大海里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, where you have to spread the ashes over the ocean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.10,1:16:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那大概会毒死一千条鲸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a way to poison about a thousand whales.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.11,1:16:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,至少一千\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.40,1:16:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我们都得去给这个混蛋送行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, we owe the big bastard a send-off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.95,1:16:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我可以打赢他 - 我知道你能打赢他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I would have win. - I know you would have win.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.46,1:16:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,至少一百万条鲸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More like a million whales.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.51,1:18:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,现在是3点36分 我们有20分钟的时间扫平这个地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's 3:36. We have 20 minutes to take this place down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.97,1:18:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,地下室交给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take the cellar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.89,1:18:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,有人来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.39,1:18:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,交给我 你们快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got him. You guys take off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.17,1:18:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,能告诉我为什么我训练出来的士兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there a reason you've taken the soldiers this man has trained{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.96,1:18:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,被你弄得像白痴一样吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and made them look like fools?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.26,1:18:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是真正的战士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They look like warriors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.76,1:18:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,忠于我的战士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Warriors loyal to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.43,1:18:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我本以为是本地人 找了这些雇佣军来杀我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought the people of Vilena hired these mercenaries to kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.77,1:19:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,但我转念一想 也许是你安排的 因为你控制不了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But then I think maybe this is your plan, because you cannot control me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.74,1:19:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你严刑拷打桑德拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And torturing Sandra works for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.78,1:19:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你想杀了她 让我难过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to kill her to make me suffer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.04,1:19:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,只要是人 就绝不会对孩子下毒手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A man can never kill a child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.46,1:19:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,除了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.13,1:19:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're losing your mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.13,1:19:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你控制不了我！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do not control me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.63,1:19:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,把桑德拉带来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring Sandra here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.64,1:19:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,马上把她带来 不然我杀了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring her now or I will kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.81,1:19:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,把她带来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go get her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.20,1:22:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定她不会认出我们吗
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.14,1:22:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,她看不见 放心玩
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.69,1:22:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,再说 这个婊子早晚得死
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.00,1:22:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,死到临头了  跟我们乐一乐吧
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.31,1:22:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,快来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.04,1:22:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你就别叫了 没人能听见
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.12,1:22:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,别碰我 你们这些禽兽
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.15,1:22:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,看来得给你点儿厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.32,1:22:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不要 不要 - 桑德拉 桑德拉 是我 桑德拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, no. - Sandra, Sandra, it's me. Sandra.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.87,1:22:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是我 是我 桑德拉 是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, it's me, it's me. Sandra, it's me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.83,1:22:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,是我 是我 别害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's me. It's me. It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.96,1:22:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,没人会伤害你 知道吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody's gonna hurt you, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.21,1:22:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么会在这里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are you here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.96,1:22:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.17,1:22:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你能走吗? - 能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can you move? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.59,1:22:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.68,1:23:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, okay. All right, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.94,1:23:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 起来 - 让我们看看你有什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get off. - Let's see what you got here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.37,1:23:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.37,1:23:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goddamn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.04,1:23:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,既然你不需要 我就要了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm having these babies, seeing as you ain't gonna need them anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.80,1:23:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题 我要问你几个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, I'm gonna ask you a few questions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.09,1:23:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该给我答案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna give me answers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.84,1:23:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,答错了 你就死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If they're not the right answers, you will die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.89,1:23:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么你会在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.31,1:23:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,观察鸟类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bird watching.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.56,1:23:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不 让他住手！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.40,1:23:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不关他的事 你们冲我来！ - 把她带出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is not his fight. It's mine. - Get her out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.61,1:23:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,封锁这座楼！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seal the building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.37,1:24:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,真是条硬汉 对不对?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a real tough guy, aren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.95,1:24:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.25,1:24:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,时间到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time's up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.33,1:24:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 巴尼呢? - 现在怎么办?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's Barney? - What's the call?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.92,1:24:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,十分钟内还找不到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't find him in 10 minutes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.00,1:24:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就沿原路返回\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we're going out the same way we came in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.09,1:24:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不行 - 这是他的意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No way. - That's what he'd want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.21,1:24:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,十分钟！行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten minutes! Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.55,1:24:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 你叫什么名字?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi. What's your name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.85,1:24:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 玩的开心吧 伙计? - 是啊 还不坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You having fun yet, mate? - Yeah, not bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.81,1:24:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,就我本人而言 很高兴你回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Personally, I'm glad you came back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.43,1:24:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.81,1:24:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,让他起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.94,1:24:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,让他站起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand him up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.61,1:24:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,如果没有这件防弹衣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, if you didn't have this Kevlar vest,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.37,1:24:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你里面会变成一团浆糊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your insides are gonna be like fucking mush.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.74,1:24:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, ain't that sad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.25,1:24:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你真走运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, you're a lucky man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.29,1:24:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你也走运了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the lucky man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.87,1:24:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 你走运了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, you're a lucky man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.83,1:24:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他让我别把你打昏过去 - 是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He told me to keep you conscious. - Did he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.17,1:24:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.97,1:25:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你最后一次机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now this is your last time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.68,1:25:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,对我说实话 我给你一个痛快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You give me the right answer, and I'll cut you a break.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.10,1:25:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,如果敢骗我 我让你生不如死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you give me the wrong answer, you will die a damn slow death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.15,1:25:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,明白吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you understand me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.77,1:25:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 明白吗? - 明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you understand me? - Yep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.65,1:25:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谁派你来的? - 我没法呼吸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who sent you? - Can't breathe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.78,1:25:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,松开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Loosen up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.91,1:25:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,谁派你来的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who sent you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.66,1:25:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你的理发师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your hairdresser.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.22,1:26:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你很不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.80,1:27:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,走 我们走！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, we gotta go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.82,1:28:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.35,1:28:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,该死！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.37,1:29:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,记住这把枪！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember this shit at Christmas!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.42,1:29:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,奶奶的 这玩意太响了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn, that thing's loud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.50,1:29:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你怎么了? - 被人扁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What happened to you? - I got my ass kicked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.09,1:29:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,该死 很疼啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn, that stings!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.60,1:29:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,好好享受吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suck it up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.72,1:29:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,把我的枪给我 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Get my rifle. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.33,1:29:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.79,1:29:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,一切的祸乱都是你带来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything bad that has happened, you bring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.54,1:29:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,拿着你的钱！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take your money!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.25,1:29:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,和你合作死路一条 拿上钱 离开这！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I only see death with you. Take it all and go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.76,1:29:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我哪也不去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not going anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.05,1:29:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这里不欢迎你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are done here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.38,1:29:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,没我 你成不了事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't succeed without me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.89,1:29:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这里我做主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am the leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.18,1:29:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是个傀儡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a puppet in a hat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.39,1:30:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.89,1:30:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我应该像你一样
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.28,1:30:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,行动！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.58,1:30:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.96,1:30:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,太老套了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This shit's getting old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.30,1:30:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,放下你们的武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Throw down your weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.34,1:30:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你们逃不掉的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no way out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.35,1:30:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你的幸运戒指真没用 - 我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Your lucky ring stinks. - I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.02,1:30:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们原路返回 - 整栋楼都被包围了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's backtrack. - The building's rigged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.69,1:30:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,只有这条路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the only way out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.69,1:30:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这些美国侵略者想要毁掉我们的国家
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.32,1:30:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,直升飞机五分钟后就可以起飞了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chopper's ready in five minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.53,1:31:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,等一会再走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not leaving yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.53,1:31:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,原谅我 原谅我的贪婪 我的自私
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.38,1:31:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他在说什么? - 他说我们死定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's he saying? - He said we're dead with an accent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.21,1:31:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不会死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We ain't dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.67,1:31:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 炸掉这座楼 - 还没到时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Blow the building. - Not yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.51,1:31:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要杀死这些美国病毒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will kill this American disease.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.51,1:31:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,开火！
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.70,1:31:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,炸楼！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blow the building!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.11,1:31:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,她还在里面！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's still in there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.49,1:31:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,拿上钱！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The money!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.33,1:31:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,快炸！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blow it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.09,1:32:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,她出来了 快炸了这他妈的楼！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's out. Blow the fucking building!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.99,1:33:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,没子弹了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.55,1:34:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.22,1:34:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,截住芒罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut Munroe off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.91,1:35:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,来啊！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.02,1:37:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.52,1:37:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 东西太重了 - 给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thing's too heavy. - Give me it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.90,1:37:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你想让我干什么? - 能扔多远扔多远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you want me to do? - Throw it as hard as you can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.93,1:37:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 炸掉仓库 - 明白！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Blow the dump. - Got it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.38,1:38:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,芒罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Munroe!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.92,1:38:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,放下武器 不然我打爆她的头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop the weapons, or I'll put a bullet through her eye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.76,1:38:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我说到做到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't test me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.90,1:38:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不要 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.40,1:38:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴 不然宰了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up or I'll kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.78,1:38:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,是中情局的人雇你们的 是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The agency parasites hired you, didn't they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.74,1:38:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,为我干 你们可以轻轻松松拿双倍的钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd have paid you twice as much to go fishing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.12,1:38:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你们以为我会那么傻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'd have to think I'm pretty freaking stupid{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.71,1:38:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,向中情局投降\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to surrender to the agency.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.59,1:38:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我为什么要这么做? 是我一手建起了这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would I do that? I created this. I made it all happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.72,1:38:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他们想踢开我 为什么? 因为我比他们更有远见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then they wanted me out. Why? Because I saw the big picture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.14,1:39:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不像她父亲 你 还有中情局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unlike people like her father, you, the agency,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.39,1:39:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你的眼界太狭隘了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you see life through a freaking keyhole{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.39,1:39:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,因为感情影响了你的判断\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because you let emotions cloud your judgment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.44,1:39:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,感情是理智的天敌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emotions are the cancer of the intellect!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.86,1:39:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,别过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop walking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.82,1:39:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你和我呢?我们是一类人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what about me and you? We're both the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.95,1:39:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都唯利是图 我们的灵魂都死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're both mercenaries. We're both dead inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.70,1:39:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你究竟为什么要杀我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So why the hell did you come after me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.58,1:39:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是为了你 蠢货 我是为了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't come after you, dipshit. I came for her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.23,1:39:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧? - 没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You okay? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.73,1:39:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我们打平了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call it a tie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:53.86,1:39:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,算是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I guess so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.78,1:39:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你没你想像的那么快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, you're not as fast as you think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.36,1:40:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我也感觉到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm beginning to sense that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.41,1:40:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,第二个账号是我的 帮你们重建家园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The second account number's mine. It'll help get things going around here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.41,1:40:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 我不能要 你已经帮了我们很多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I can't. You've done so much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.04,1:40:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你也帮了我 礼尚往来 拿着吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, so have you. A gift for a gift. You take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.42,1:40:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你还会回来吗? - 我一定会回来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Will you come back? - I promise I'll always be around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.76,1:41:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,保重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.29,1:41:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,干嘛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.00,1:41:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,让我说实话吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Truthfully?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.63,1:41:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:37.25,1:41:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得她不适合你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never really thought she was your type.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.49,1:42:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 宝贝 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, baby. All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.41,1:42:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 显显身手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's see what you got.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.41,1:42:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好样的！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's my boy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.04,1:42:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不行喽！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go south!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.13,1:42:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你输了！你输了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You lost! You lost!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.60,1:42:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,在鬼门关打了一回转 伤好了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you're back from the dead. How you healing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.52,1:42:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 你放了我一马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good, considering you could have killed me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.48,1:42:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我原谅你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I forgive you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.19,1:42:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.07,1:42:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我本来可以打赢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would have win.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.28,1:42:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.53,1:42:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 根拿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Gunner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.20,1:42:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,大难不死必有后福 兄弟 别忘了治疗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever doesn't kill you makes you stronger, brother. Therapy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.08,1:42:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他说什么? - 他说去治疗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's he saying? - He said try therapy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.87,1:42:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,他说的没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man's got a point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.26,1:43:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.34,1:43:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我送你一样东西 杜尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna do you a favor, Tool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.89,1:43:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,“我以前认识一叫杜尔的人”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"I once knew a man called Tool..."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.51,1:43:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢诗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love poetry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:13.68,1:43:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,“在我看来 这人就是酷的化身”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"To me, was the epitome of cool{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.44,1:43:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,“他是个刀中行家”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"He was good with a knife{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.69,1:43:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,“却是个情场输家…”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Bad with a wife..."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.74,1:43:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,真毒舌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That hurts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:26.90,1:43:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,“他以为能打败我”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"But to think he could beat me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.20,1:43:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,“连做梦都想打败我”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Dreaming he'd defeat me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.83,1:43:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,“酷杜尔”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Cool Tool{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.50,1:43:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,“你真傻”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"You gotta be a fool"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.96,1:43:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,看招\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah.{\r}
